• the timing of market introduction of our drugs and drug candidates as well as competitive drugs;
• the cost of treatment in relation to alternative treatments;
• the availability of adequate coverage, reimbursement and pricing by third-party payors and government
authorities;
• the willingness of patients to pay out-of-pocket in the absence of coverage and reimbursement by third-party
payors and government authorities; and
• the effectiveness of our sales and marketing efforts.
